OL,3,GNEWSARegional mayor deal in 'final
OL,4,Astages' - government
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has announced it is in
OL,7,Fthe "final stages" of establishing a
OL,8,Fregional mayor role for Leicester,
OL,9,FLeicestershire and Rutland.
OL,11,FThe move was announced in documents
OL,12,Faccompanying the Budget announced by
OL,13,FChancellor John Healey on Wednesday.
OL,15,FThe new role would come with additional
OL,16,Fdevolved powers and funding from
OL,17,FWhitehall for strategic decisions on
OL,18,Ftransport, housing and adult education.
OL,20,FMinisters aim to have devolution deals
OL,21,Fin place everywhere in England by the
OL,22,Fend of 2028.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
